### 2026-11-01 07:09 ET — nflverse pbp_participation_2026 (re-download attempt)
- **Symptom:** re-download from the nflverse pbp_participation release returned HTTP 404; the saved file is 9 bytes, not a parquet.
- **Root cause:** the 2026 participation asset isn't published on the nflverse release, so the earlier download saved a "Not Found" body.
