### 2026-11-01 07:26 ET — assemble.py (alts keys, ESPN week mapping, indoor roof)
- **Symptom:** (1) TypeError comparing str and float alt keys. (2) Diggs ESPN box targets [9, None, 7] vs pbp [7, 9, 7]. (3) The LAR (SoFi, indoor) Puka over was cut for 15 mph wind.
