### 2026-11-01 07:27 ET — sim_v5 role-change blind spot (Rachaad White WSH rush under)
- **Symptom:** the Rachaad White rush U39.5 showed +27 pts edge (avg p .772) vs a market of 39.5–44.5.
- **Root cause:** Croskey-Merritt has 0 carries since Week 6 and isn't on the injury report, and White is now depth-chart RB1. A history-weighted carry share (0.22–0.44) can't see the vacated role.
